              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Afalume 2:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabii Elisha wagbwirwa ni ukongo ambao kala undamurya. Phaphi mfalume Jehoashi wa Iziraeli wakpwendamjambosa. Wamsengerera Elisha kuno anarira achiamba, “Baba, baba! Mkanizi wa Iziraeli, uwe u dza magari ga kuvwehwa ni farasi na aphirikie!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha achimuamba, “Hala uha na mivi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achihala uha na mivi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha wamuambira mfalume wa Iziraeli, “Tonyola uha,” mfalume achiutonyola, na Elisha achiika mikonoye dzulu ya mikono ya mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu achiamba, “Vugula dirisha ra uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa,” achirivugula. Elisha achiamba, “Latsa,” naye achilatsa. Nabii achiamba, “Muvwi wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wa ushindi, muvwi ambao undaturya Aaramu. Uwe undapigana na Aaramu hiko Afeki hadi uaangamize tsetsetse.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Elisha achimuamba, “Hala mivi yanjina,” Mfalume achiihala. Elisha achimuamba ye mfalume wa Iziraeli, “Latsa photsi.” Mfalume walatsa mivi photsi kano tahu, chisha achiricha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye mutu wa Mlungu wareya sana, achimuambira mfalume, “Ungelatsa kano tsano au sita hivi, hipho ungeaangamiza Aaramu tsetsetse. Ela sambi undaashinda kano tahu tu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha wafwa, naye achizikpwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila mwaka, makundi ga Amoabu kala gachedzapiga viha tsi ya Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga, wakati Aiziraeli anjinae kala anazika mutu, chikosi dza hicho chazembuka. Phahi hinyo Aiziraeli aritsupha rira lufu kpwenye mbira ya Elisha. Mara tu lufu hiro ririphoguta mifupha ya Elisha, hiye marehemu wafufuka na achiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
